# Copy to .env (mode 600). Never commit it.
#
# Org runners: a fine-grained PAT, resource owner = the org, organization permission
# "Self-hosted runners: read and write". If the same token drives the overflow controller, add
# repository permission "Actions: read" on the repos it watches.
MY_ORG_TOKEN=
# Or a GitHub App instead (its own rate limit; see docs/runners.md, "GitHub App"):
# MY_APP_ID=
# MY_APP_KEY="-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\n"
# Repo-level runners: a fine-grained PAT on those repos, repository permission
# "Administration: read and write" (what runner registration needs).
PERSONAL_TOKEN=
# Optional: the runner image tag (default werkbank-runner:local).
# WERKBANK_IMAGE=werkbank-runner:local
